{"2508440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angel Guardian", "steam_appid": 2508440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/0a75da6fa2aeec428e657ba1453b054a.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter built around fast combat, smart movement, and constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden attack cripples the Space Station kingdom of Alterra, its systems turn against you — and survival becomes the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=960 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/83876e26869abb0341fd900861c86ab2.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive using multiple tools and playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, fast-paced shooting built for constant movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 8 double-upgradeable rifles plus a sword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth options to avoid combat or strike quietly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking systems to disable defenses, crack codes, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly enemies and boss encounters that demand quick reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/bee35a926420f97d0e97b428564981b4.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Guardian features Twitch Chat Integration that lets viewers affect the game in real time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn enemies right in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop ammo when you’re desperate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger Eiji’s superpowers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run becomes unpredictable —share the IDs with your chat and let them unleash mayhem live while you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/3c759216814304c07f4d4d57b90cbf02.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>You play as <strong>Kita</strong>, a warrior guardian sent to extract a young prince after the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey unfolds, the prince fights alongside you, unlocking powerful abilities while you help him awaken his true potential as the kingdom’s rightful heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an escort mission. This is a fight to take control back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cafeb410eada88402a5caec98c4878dc.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>Tested by 100+ players across multiple closed test sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/d7ec72d802ae0322a6b499795c2f82e3.avif?t=1785797243\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to stay updated and not miss the launch. See you out there, Guardian!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/0a75da6fa2aeec428e657ba1453b054a.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter built around fast combat, smart movement, and constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden attack cripples the Space Station kingdom of Alterra, its systems turn against you — and survival becomes the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=960 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/032ee901c95402ff0434a3e58c78bd5d.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/83876e26869abb0341fd900861c86ab2.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive using multiple tools and playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, fast-paced shooting built for constant movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 8 double-upgradeable rifles plus a sword.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth options to avoid combat or strike quietly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking systems to disable defenses, crack codes, and gain access to hidden areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly enemies and boss encounters that demand quick reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/4b6197184e8119263830186313cac6e8.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/bee35a926420f97d0e97b428564981b4.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Guardian features Twitch Chat Integration that lets viewers affect the game in real time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn enemies right in your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop ammo when you’re desperate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger Eiji’s superpowers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run becomes unpredictable —share the IDs with your chat and let them unleash mayhem live while you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.poster.avif?t=1785797243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.webm?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/a7acf9617458e425ac5ae5a8fae46e05.mp4?t=1785797243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/3c759216814304c07f4d4d57b90cbf02.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>You play as <strong>Kita</strong>, a warrior guardian sent to extract a young prince after the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey unfolds, the prince fights alongside you, unlocking powerful abilities while you help him awaken his true potential as the kingdom’s rightful heir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an escort mission. This is a fight to take control back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/cafeb410eada88402a5caec98c4878dc.avif?t=1785797243\" width=856 height=188 /></span>Tested by 100+ players across multiple closed test sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/extras/d7ec72d802ae0322a6b499795c2f82e3.avif?t=1785797243\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now to stay updated and not miss the launch. See you out there, Guardian!</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Angel Guardian is a sci-fi side-scrolling action shooter set in a space station under attack. Play as Kita, a warrior guardian on a mission to rescue the young prince while fighting hostile enemies. Use shooting, stealth and hacking to face powerful bosses and prove yourself as a true guardian.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“In a market where side-scrolling shooters continue to appear frequently, standing out is no easy feat. However, this game finds its niche by combining familiar elements with less conventional ideas.”<br>Kotaku<br><br>“The gaming world continues to evolve, but Angel Guardian is taking interaction to another level. This new title from Corgee proposes an idea as chaotic as it is brilliant: allowing Twitch chat to directly influence your gameplay in real time .”<br>MultiAnime<br><br>“The idea of protecting a prince who grows into a real partner gives the story a clean emotional shape. The Twitch integration gives the game a modern party-trick edge. The sci-fi anime flavour gives it personality. And the whole thing has just enough danger of going completely off the rails to make it worth watching”<br>Generation Amiga<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/3da9515c202c6f25a4dd86ddc65b9c0d9ea42478/header.jpg?t=1785797243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/a803ec96d5f63c36c3d7d740ff5586039430c35b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785797243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508440/a803ec96d5f63c36c3d7d740ff5586039430c35b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785797243", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-4790 @ 3.60GHz / Ryzen 5 2600 @ 3.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 3 GB / Radeon RX 550 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 -11600K @ 3.60GHz / Ryzen 5 5600x @ 3.7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 / Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><stro